The '''Croaking Plateau''' is a terrace overlooking the [[Ruins of Breezehaven]] in northern [[Balor]]. A corps of ten [[SI:7]] operatives made camp here to survey the port ruins for any suspicious activity, but were captured by the [[Stormreaver clan]]. All but [[Agent Deryl]], who was taken to the inn by [[Sorrowmore Lake]], were killed.

